flowchart LR
    U[Authenticated complainant] --> V1[Validate CSRF and fields]
    V1 --> V2[Validate priority, category, and secure attachments]
    V2 --> V3[Create complaint transaction]
    V3 --> R[Generate GRV reference number]
    R --> S[Calculate SLA due date]
    S --> W[(Complaints table)]
    W --> T[Write submitted timeline event]
    W --> N[Create administrator notifications]
    W --> E[Queue/log email notifications]
    W --> A[Write audit log]
    T --> TL[(Complaint timeline)]
    N --> NT[(Notifications)]
    E --> EM[(Email notifications)]
    A --> AL[(Audit logs)]
    W --> C[Return reference and dashboard redirect]
